                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "D2: Problem Description",
                        "style": [
                            "bold"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Here are 5 key points about semiconductors in English:"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. **Semiconductors** are materials with electrical conductivity between conductors and insulators, enabling precise control of electron flow."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2. **Silicon** dominates the industry due to its abundance, ideal bandgap, and excellent native oxide properties for manufacturing."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3. **Doping** introduces impurities into pure semiconductors to create N-type (electron-rich) or P-type (hole-rich) materials essential for device operation."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "4. **CMOS technology** combines complementary MOSFETs to achieve low power consumption and high noise immunity in modern integrated circuits."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5. **Advanced nodes** below 3nm now employ **Gate-All-Around (GAA)** transistors to overcome physical limitations and maintain Moore's Law progression."
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
